ameplay- Changed the room generation logic. You should now encounter more rooms with interesting content.- New anomalies have been added- New settings have been added for your convenience(Not necessary for those who ha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:05:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691552","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4072920-1840944183773333","game_id":"steam-4072920","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 1.0.7","summary":"Hey, everyone! Over the last couple of days, I’ve been watching people play through the game and seeing what problems they’re encountering.The main issue is that I didn’t explain the rules for progressing through the rooms in sufficient detail, and many people are struggling because they haven’t understood them.In the latest updates, I’ve added a note clarifying the rules. That should help with this. When I expand the demo content and add the story elements from the full game, I’ll bring in some","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T08:28:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183773333","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4072920-1840310314349052","game_id":"steam-4072920","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.0.4","summary":"Hi, everyone!Today I'm releasing another update:- Added support for Spanish and Portuguese (Brazilian)- Fixed interactions with colliders in various locations (the \"Shark\" anomaly, doorways, NPC colliders)- Improved interactions with doors- Updated the content of the “Credits” tab- Minor visual tweaksSpecial thanks to prietonn for the high-quality Spanish translation!Thanks to all of you and have a nice Sunday! - Denis","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-09T10:23:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314349052","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4072920-1840310314347487","game_id":"steam-4072920","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 1.0.3","summary":"Hi! Today I’m expanding the list of languages a bit (I’m choosing them based on the number of people who speak that language in the Wishlist). Added languages: - German - TurkishThe rules board texture has been localized.Lighting in some areas has been improved.Interaction with the Jungle anomaly has been updated. Upcoming changes: Spanish language support, achievements. Thank you to everyone who has already tried the demo version. I look forward to hearing your feedback on it. If you have any q","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T13:44:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314347487","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4072920-1840310314345443","game_id":"steam-4072920","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo release","summary":"Hi, everyone! Today I’m finally releasing the demo version of the first act of “True Nightmare - Diner Loop” to the public. While maintaining the atmosphere of the first part, I wanted to try combining it with the popular “loop” genre. I hope it turned out interesting. Over the weekend, I’ll add support for Turkish and German (numbers 3 and 4 on the wish list). If you have any language requests, let me know and I’ll try to add that one too. I’ll be releasing a few more updates to this demo versi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T15:53:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314345443","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4072920-1839676055890903","game_id":"steam-4072920","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo release date!","summary":"Hi, everyone!I'm happy to finally announce that the demo version of True Nightmare: Diner Loop will be available on August 7th.As I mentioned earlier, I’ve taken a much more thorough approach to this release, and the very first version will be stable and user-friendly.I still plan to expand its content over time, but I’d love to hear your feedback right now and hope you have a great time playing the game!Some interesting points:- The demo takes about 20 minutes to complete, but given the unique ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-01T15:21:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055890903","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4072920-1830797770237089","game_id":"steam-4072920","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo release soon!","summary":"Hi everyone, it's Denis here!After some time of waiting, I’d like to announce the upcoming release of the demo version! Unlike the first part, where the demo served as a prologue, this time it will be a portion of the game’s opening.Just like with the first part, there will be a beta test open to anyone who wants to participate.I’ll share more details within the week.Thanks to everyone for your support - see you very soon!In the meantime, add the game to your Wishlists and follow me on social me","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-24T18:19:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770237089","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4072920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:32Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:31Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4072920":"2026-10-26T11:23:32Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4072920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:31Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:31Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:31Z"},"4964870":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:32Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:32Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:32Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4072920","app_id":4072920,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:27Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"bcabb78a445d589c604fd6dccaebbc3fd74cc6f42ad9a4171ad922605390aac6","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"불길한 VHS 레트로 감성이 살아 있는 분위기 넘치는 심리 공포를 경험하세요. 신입 FBI 요원이 된 당신은 외딴 도로변 카페에서 반복되는 이상 현상 속에 갇히게 됩니다. 방을 하나씩 탐험할수록 악몽은 더욱 깊어지고… 무언가가 집요하게 당신을 뒤쫓습니다.","publishers":[{"name":" Frost Fox Studios"}],"developers":[{"name":" Frost Fox Studios"}],"franchises":[{"name":"True Nightmare"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1806476400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Announcement trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1770390013","trailer_category":3,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4072920/815541483/1d6f4d31b25582b93364ae8e464b20e19aad6c8f/1770310201/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4072920/815541483/1d6f4d31b25582b93364ae8e464b20e19aad6c8f/1770310201/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_pa